{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28625","headline":"卢秀才将出王屋高步名场江南相逢赠别 · 杜牧","name":"卢秀才将出王屋高步名场江南相逢赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王屋山人有古文，欲攀青桂弄氛氲。\n将携健笔干明主，莫向仙坛问白云。\n驰逐宁教争处让，是非偏忌衆人分。\n交游话我凭君道，除却鲈鱼更不闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}